  "translation": "Na em bai i kamap: yu skelim ⟨את⟩ em long olgeta bilong yu olgeta olsem samting ol i givim long ol pikinini, na long ol man i stap wantaim yu, ol man i no bilong ples i stap namel long yu, ol i gat pikinini namel long yu olgeta; na ol bai i stap olsem man bilong ples namel long ol pikinini bilong Yisrael, wantaim yu olgeta ol bai kisim olgeta bilong ol pikinini long namel bilong ol lain bilong Yisrael.",
